// The Playroom - a Tsumiki sample cart.
//
// Zenmai, a wind-up tin toy, tidies five stars into the toy box. Stick or d-pad: run (the way
// depends on the camera). A: jump (hold for higher). Y: next camera (follow, orbit, eyes,
// corner, rail). L/R: turn the follow camera. X: cost counters. START: begin / back to the
// title.
//
// The toys (Zenmai's rig and clips, the toy chest, the train, the star, textures) come from
// toys.toy through tools/tsumiki.py; the room is built from Tsumiki shapes in room.akr; the
// game is game.akr, which a test can import with scripted input (tests/lang/tsumiki_playroom.akr).
cart "The Playroom", "TSUMIKI-PLAYROOM"

import "game.akr"
